# BEGIN odile-testing
# testing.odile.fyi — retired as a surface on 2026-11-11 (Savio direction).
#
# One destination serves manual testing and the hackathon demo: demo.odile.fyi.
# The prototype this host carried teaches the six-act ceremony the strict bar
# deletes ("Claim your machine"), so serving it again would mislead a tester.
# The hostname stays only as a 301 so posts, screenshots and the runbook that
# name it do not 404.
#
# Committed source of truth for the live block in /etc/caddy/Caddyfile; apply
# with deploy/caddy/deploy_testing_host.py. Edit this file, not the live file.
testing.odile.fyi {
	redir https://demo.odile.fyi{uri} permanent
}
# END odile-testing
